  "content": "# 第22题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n22. What will UNESCO provide for the internship period？\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Limited medical insurance coverage．\n\nB. B. Training in communication skills．\n\nC. C. A medical certificate for work．\n\nD. D. Financial support for travel．\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nA\n\n",
  "answer": "C",
  "analysis": "本题考查定语从句。先行词是the factory，关系词在从句中作地点状语，故用where。"
}